            <p>Nossa massa é preparada diariamente com fermentação lenta, garantindo crocância e leveza inigualáveis.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
            <!-- Ícone Ingredientes -->
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17.5 4.5c-1.95 0-4.05.4-5.5 1.5-1.45-1.1-3.55-1.5-5.5-1.5S2.45 4.9 1 6v14.65c0 .25.25.5.5.5.1 0 .15-.05.25-.05C3.1 20.45 5.05 20 6.5 20c1.95 0 4.05.4 5.5 1.5 1.35-.85 3.8-1.5 5.5-1.5 1.65 0 3.35.3 4.75 1.05.1.05.15.05.25.05.25 0 .5-.25.5-.5V6c-1.45-1.1-3.55-1.5-5.5-1.5zM12 19.5c-1.15-.55-2.8-1-5.5-1-1.4 0-2.8.25-4 .6V7.15c1.1-.35 2.5-.5 4-.5 1.9 0 3.7.4 5.5 1.15v11.7z"/></svg>
